<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 2000s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 21st century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 2000s BCE, 33 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 13 were founded and 3 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Neo-Sumerian Empire, the Elamite Confederation and the Uruk.</p></header>
